# What makes "self-service through a PR" true rather than aspirational: a squad's own folder
# is approved by that squad, not by the platform team. Combined with branch protection
# ("require code owner review" + required status checks) and auto-merge, a manifest-only PR
# merges with no platform human involved.
#
# Copy to .github/CODEOWNERS in the platform repo. Later rules win, so the catch-all comes first.

*                                   @contoso/platform-team

/platform/squads/orders/            @contoso/squad-orders
/platform/squads/payments/          @contoso/squad-payments

# The contract itself stays with platform: a squad can use the API, not change it.
/platform/schema/                   @contoso/platform-team
